Abstract = {ADMS-Urban has been used in approximately half of the pilot studies of
   air pollution recently carried out in the UK. The pilot areas varied in
   spatial extent and in the nature of the sources, the balance between
   traffic, industrial and domestic sources, and the pollutants which are
