   19-21, 2018},
Abstract = {The good design of the urban fabric to deal with the natural physical
   loads for achieving the physical urban comfort, it's enabled the cities
   of desert to live and develop in the desert climate. So the
   constructivist density of the urban fabric is considered one of the most
   important elements of the urban design, it's responsible of the height
   of the building where the shade and his alternation throughout the day,
   the shaded area where the convection, natural lighting are low, and are
   protected from wind. The methodology of the research was based on the
   comparative approach, where the field research tool represented in the
   questionnaire for the population of two urban fabric different in terms
   of the constructivism density, about their feeling towards the physical
   urban comfort. Where the questionnaire asked about the temperature of
   the air and the level of natural light and wind protection level in the
   free space in their neighborhood. Through the obtained results and use
   the comparison approach, we noticed the difference of the answers about
   the sense and satisfaction of the population towards the elements of
   natural physical loads in the two types of urban fabric, where were a
   better feeling for the population of the urban fabric a greatest in
   terms of constructivism density for the natural physical loads compared
   with the feeling of the population of the other fabric. This difference
   in results indicates the role of urban fabric for reducing natural
   physical loads within the free space- street-. where the urban fabric
   the more of the constructivism density is the more of the shade during
   the day, it's the best in terms of achieving the physical urban comfort,
   this is very important for desert cities. 2019 The Authors. Published by
