Abstract = {Waterfront is the important resource in the urban exploitation, and it
   is also the district which needs the high efficient supply of the urban
   public facilities. This paper takes the urban waterfront as the research
   object, introduces the greenway conception and mode from the view of
   urban design. Based on the characters of the vertical bank greenway,
   such as the linearity and high accessibility, high connection and
   compact multifunction, it tries to bring forward a new mode of the city
   public facilities, in which we construct the urban public facilities of
   low-density, mixed function with the ecological, low-density greenway.
   At last, this paper discusses the space mode and character of the
