   State Adm Work Safety; N China Inst Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Urban community is a huge and open complex system, and it determines the
   urban community public security management is typical of complexity. In
   the paper, the characteristics of diversity, open and difficulty in
   quantitative description of urban community are discussed from micro and
   macro standpoint, furthermore, basic principles of the urban complexity
   management are presented. The above synthetic Analysis suggest that the
   complexity of the urban community system comes from the complexity of
   the people in the community and inherent essential connection between
   the system of people-society and the urban system, as well as the
   coupling of the urban system and natural environment and ecosystem: The
   comprehensive urgent situation management mechanism that western
   countries currently carry with community as core, including the
   mechanisms of preventing/mitigation, preparedness, response and
   resuming, etc. may be used in the urban community public security
   management of our country.},
