   Coll; German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; German Embassy China},
Abstract = {Along with the continuous improvement of the national vacation system,
   the Chinese tourism industry experiences rapid development. In this
   paper, the author presents her empirical study on main factors which
   influence travel decisions of urban Chinese. By taking urban residents
   in the Zibo city from the Shandong Province as the sample group, the
   author stresses that factors determines urban tourists' travel decision
   include budget, gender, education, family structures, age, and channels
   to obtain tourism information.},
