   System (GIS) with Hedonic pricing method in improving the analysis and
   determining the value of green spaces with housing prices in Subang
   Jaya, Malaysia. The previous study found that proposed combination
   between GIS and Hedonic pricing method for the same purpose has not been
   fully explored particularly in Malaysia. Findings show the proposed
   combined method leads to an improved understanding and representation of
   urban dynamics and regeneration process, furthermore will encourage a
   sustainable setting of the environmental amenities in improving the
   geospatial technologies respectively. (C) 2015 The Authors. Published by
