   Tull, Matthew T.; Rodman, Samantha A., Univ Maryland, Dept Psychol, College Pk, MD 20742 USA.
   Tull, Matthew T.; Rodman, Samantha A., Univ Maryland, Ctr Addict Personal \& Emot Res, College Pk, MD 20742 USA.
   Roemer, Lizabeth, Univ Massachusetts Boston, Dept Psychol, Boston, MA 02125 USA.},
