   07-09, 2017},
Organization = {Malaysian Tech Scientist Assoc},
Abstract = {Cyber security should be everybody's concern. More and more cyber
   security incidences are being reported as more users access the
   Internet. However, being aware and employing good practices do not mean
   being a hundred percent protected. In the academe, both students and
   teachers have to be educated in terms of security awareness and good
   practices. As teachers, the responsibility of educating the youth
   regarding cyber security falls mostly on educators. This study
   investigates the perception of cyber security among teachers. A survey
   questionnaire was distributed both hard-copy and online. 84 teachers
   were able to respond to the study. Results of this study would help
   proper authorities not limited to administrators of basic and higher
   education institutions on developing programs about cyber security among
   educators.},
