Abstract = {In this chapter I will consider the neurobiology of emotion and mood as
   informed by functional neuroimaging. I will first consider a conceptual
   division between mood and emotion. I then take classical conditioning as
   a model of emotion learning and examine the associated brain changes. I
   then consider the neurobiology of normal and pathological mood as
   revealed by functional neuroimaging experiments. The findings from these
   investigations are then discussed in the context of human lesion
   literature.},
