   Buildings/3rd International Conference on Built Environment and Public
   Health, Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 29-31, 2009},
Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {Urban sewage is a kind of excellent and reproducible heat source. Sewage
   source heat pump could make best use of the exhaust heat in urban sewage
   for heating and cooling. It has the significance of energy-saving and
   environmental protection. And the rheological characteristics of urban
   sewage are the important references for thermal and flowing
   characteristics. The paper describes the relation between the shear
   strain rate and the shear stress of urban sewage based on experiment.
   The constitutive equation of the flow working fluid is confirmed by the
   method of system identification. The results of the research indicated
   that the sewage heat pump's flow working fluid shows the characteristic
   of non-Newtonian fluid, which belongs to the yield-pseudoplastic fluid.},
